        "heading": "How has Perimeter Solutions' federal revenue trended over recent years?",
        "body": "Perimeter Solutions' obligations moved from $164M in FY21 to $106M in FY22 and $89.9M in FY23, then rose to $248M in FY24 and $319M in FY25 before reaching $343M in FY26. Perimeter Solutions' year-over-year change is up 7.5%. Perimeter Solutions' current-year total is fiscal year to date and therefore partial. Perimeter Solutions' pattern shows a decline through FY23 followed by multi-year growth into FY26."
      },
      {
        "heading": "Who are Perimeter Solutions' largest federal customers in FY2026 to date?",
